        "id": "intro-comment",
        "type": "nodetool.workflows.base_node.Comment",
        "data": {
          "comment": "# Crush It to 8 Bits\n\nGives audio a lo-fi, retro sound by reducing bit depth and sample rate. The two controls work independently, so you can tune each one.\n\n**How it works:** \"1 Audio\" takes the input. \"2 Bitcrush\" quantises to 6 bits and reduces the sample rate by a factor of 4. \"3 Result\" plays the crushed audio. It runs locally with no model or key.\n\n**Try this:** Set bit_depth on \"2 Bitcrush\" to 8 and sample_rate_reduction to 1 to hear the effect of bit depth alone."
        },
